y the acceptance criteria.\r\n*   **Data Consistency:** Ensure the format for `date`, `readTime`, and other fields exactly matches the format of other posts in the `posts.ts` file.\r\n\r\n## Iteration 2 - Tue, Apr 14, 2026  4:26:41 AM\r\nCompleted: Blog post: Living in JB Working in Singapore — Cross-Border Commuter Guide 2026 (ID: US-244) in 4m\r\n\r\n\r\n## Pre-analysis for US-246 (Gemini 2.5 Pro)\r\nThis user story is for a Next.js/TypeScript project, not Frappe/Python. Here is the technical brief based on the provided JSON:\r\n\r\n**Project:** Next.js Website (pelangi-website)\r\n**User Story:** US-246: New page: /visa-run\r\n\r\n**1. Files to Modify:**\r\n*   **Create:** `site/src/app/visa-run/page.tsx`\r\n*   **Modify:** `site/src/app/sitemap.ts`\r\n\r\n**2. Framework/Concepts Involved:**\r\n*   Next.js App Router: Creating a new route segment.\r\n*   React Server Component: The new page will be a Server Component.\r\n*   Next.js Metadata API: To set the page `<title>`.\r\n*   JSON-LD Schema: `FAQPage` and `HowTo` schemas for SEO.\r\n*   Shared Components: Importing `Header` and `Footer`.\r\n\r\n**3. Implementation Approach:**\r\n1.  Create `site/src/app/visa-run/page.tsx`.\r\n2.  Define the page's `metadata` object for the title.\r\n3.  Build the page component, importing and rendering `<Header />` and `<Footer />`.\r\n4.  Add a `<script type=\"application/ld+json\">` tag containing a valid `FAQPage` schema with 5 placeholder questions and answers about Singapore-JB visa runs.\r\n5.  Add a second `<script type=\"application/ld+json\">` tag for the `HowTo` schema, detailing a 5-step process for a visa run.\r\n6.  Include a clear Call-to-Action (CTA) button or link pointing to `/book`.\r\n7.  Edit `site/src/app/sitemap.ts` to add an entry for `/visa-run` with a `priority` of `0.85`.\r\n\r\n**4. Gotchas & Edge Cases:**\r\n*   Ensure the JSON-LD content is valid and passes schema validation tools.\r\n*   The content for the FAQ and How-To steps must be generated,